      55.15,
      363.61,
      547.23,
      410.68
    ],
    "text": "02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice Calling upon (a) the Individuals,(b) the Bodies,Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (c) the District Secretaries/ Divisional Secretaries specifiedhereinafter to submit names of person who are eligible for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for thesaid Mediation Board areas:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.75,
      423.61,
      547.2,
      446.68
    ],
    "text": "(a) The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than themselves for appointment to thePanel of a particular Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      122.95,
      459.61,
      547.17,
      494.68
    ],
    "text": "(i) a Public Officer or a Provincial Public Officer serving as the Head of a Department or as the regionalHead of a Department in an office located within the Administrative District at which that particularMediation Board area is situated:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      119.95,
      507.61,
      547.21,
      530.68
    ],
    "text": "(ii) a Head of a Place or religious worship or of a school situated in that particular Mediation Boardarea ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      116.95,
      543.61,
      547.23,
      554.68
    ],
    "text": "(iii) A retired Head of a Department or School Principal residing in that particular Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      118.75,
      567.61,
      274.75,
      578.68
    ],
    "text": "(iv) Chairman of Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.15,
      591.61,
      547.18,
      614.68
    ],
    "text": "(b) The following Boards, Organizations and Institutions of Non-political nature are entitled to submitnominations for appointment to the Panel of Mediators of any Mediation Board area ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      122.95,
      627.61,
      547.18,
      650.68
    ],
    "text": "(i) Any board, Organizations or Institution which has been in existence at least for a period of five yearsand which is engaged in carrying out or doing anyone or more of the under mentioned objectives;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.75,
      663.61,
      547.18,
      674.68
    ],
    "text": "(a) The enhancement of educational, religious, moral and spiritual, advancement of the community;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.15,
      687.61,
      419.37,
      698.68
    ],
    "text": "(b) The enhancement of social welfare and eradication of poverty;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.15,
      711.61,
      386.4,
      722.68
    ],
    "text": "(c) The enhancement of rural or community development;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      145.15,
      735.61,
      324.57,
      746.68
    ],
    "text": "(d) The enhancement of culture and sports;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      63.67,
      102.13,
      496.27,
      113.2
    ],
    "text": "Administrative DistrictMediation Board AreasDate of Vacation of Post",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      50.61,
      71.17,
      537.81,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2017'07'19PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 19.07.20173A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      137.85,
      100.69,
      537.89,
      123.76
    ],
    "text": "(e) The enhancement of projects, programmes and activities intending providing and supplyingbasic needs of the peoples such as health, food and shelter etc.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      89.85,
      136.69,
      537.86,
      159.76
    ],
    "text": "(c) The following District Secretaries/Divisional Secretaries are entitled to submit nominations for appointmentto the Panel of a particular Mediation Board Area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      115.65,
      172.69,
      537.73,
      183.76
    ],
    "text": "(i) The District Secretary of the Administrative District in which that Mediation Board area is situated;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      112.65,
      196.69,
      537.85,
      219.76
    ],
    "text": "(ii) As the following Persons are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular Mediation BoardArea whose names may be so submitted for appointment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      138.45,
      232.69,
      527.91,
      243.76
    ],
    "text": "(a) any person being a resident in Mediation Board Area and engaged in any work in that Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      137.85,
      256.69,
      537.9,
      291.76
    ],
    "text": "(b) any person resident or engaged in any work outside that Mediation Board area, howeverthe Commission is of the opinion that such particular person is eilgible in exeptionalcircumstances ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      137.85,
      304.69,
      537.97,
      339.76
    ],
    "text": "(c) any Public Officer nominated under this paragraph by the District Secretary of the AdministrativeDistrict within which that Mediation Board is situated is eligible for appointment to the Panelof Mediators of every Mediation Board area within that Administrative District;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      137.85,
      352.69,
      537.97,
      375.76
    ],
    "text": "(d) the present Chairman, Mediators of Panels of Mediators who are due to vacate posts upon thecompletion of three years.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      82.65,
      388.69,
      537.88,
      423.76
    ],
    "text": "03. (a) Individual and Boards, Organizations and Institutions referred to Paragraph (02) above may submitnominations of such Public Officers as are specified in Paragraph 2(a) and 2(b) above. An individualmay not nominate his or her name for nomination.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      101.85,
      436.69,
      537.86,
      459.76
    ],
    "text": "(b) District Secretary referred to in Paragraph 2(c) above may submit nominations of Public Officers ofwho not more than five may be appointed by the Commission to the relevant Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      472.69,
      194.86,
      483.76
    ],
    "text": "04. Form of Nominations:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      99.45,
      496.69,
      406.67,
      507.76
    ],
    "text": "(a)Individuals should submit nomination substantially in Form (a) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      98.85,
      520.69,
      537.82,
      531.76
    ],
    "text": "(b)Boards, Organizations and Institutions should submit nominations substantially in Form (b) below; and.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      98.85,
      544.69,
      537.85,
      555.76
    ],
    "text": "(c)District Secretaries, Divisional Secretaries should submit nominations substantially in Form (c) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      568.69,
      537.86,
      591.76
    ],
    "text": "Each nomination should be in a separate form and should without fail contain the recommendation of thenominator as indicated in the next Paragraph.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      604.69,
      537.97,
      675.76
    ],
    "text": "05. The recommendation of the nominator should not be a being assigned recommendation without reasons. Itrequired to set out specific facts and circumstances to enable the Commission to draw its own reference to the suitabilityor otherwise of the person nominated for appointment to the Panel of Mediators, such as, for instance, his or her personor past occupation, the period of service or engagement in such occupations, any position or trust or responsibility heldby him or her and the office, if any, held by him or her in any social service/ religious/charitable Organization, Society orBoard.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      688.69,
      537.96,
      723.76
    ],
    "text": "06. An individual or a Board, Organizations or Institution should as far as possible, refrain from making morethan three nominations in respect of the same Mediation Board area. However, this limitation will not apply to the presentChairman of the Panel of Mediators and to the District Secretaries, and Divisional Secretaries.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      73.09,
